Revision history for Typesense-Client

0.001     2026-08-29 01:53:21+02:00 Europe/Madrid
  - First release. Full Typesense v28+ API surface: collections, documents
    (including JSONL import/export), aliases, search and multi_search,
    synonyms, overrides (curation), analytics rules and events, API keys and
    scoped search keys, plus a comparable server version object.
